{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "0519f387edc4",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T13:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/accountable-mixed-use-ai-crawlers/",
  "sourceTitle": "Have it both ways: stay discoverable in search while disallowing AI training",
  "sourceBodyHash": "fc1be4510b1b99d297425451c204e6267e9273014ed6d07bf14a473d237c9a3a",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-03T13:33:01.059460Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T13:36:31.853864Z",
  "totalBlocks": 66,
  "translatedBlocks": 66,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32fe130c1a861ca5",
      "translationZh": "没有适当的控制措施，网站所有者长期面临艰难的权衡：允许您的内容用于 AI 训练，或冒失去搜索可发现性的风险。这种权衡之所以存在，是因为互联网上的一些最大组织使用混合用途爬虫：一个爬虫同时服务于搜索和 AI 训练。拒绝其中之一，就等于拒绝另一方。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c77a80f0564a4d7",
      "translationZh": "今天，Cloudflare 宣布推出新的 Disallow AI Training 设置，让您可以轻松保持在搜索中的索引，同时拒绝让同一个爬虫在您的内容上进行训练。Apple、Google 和 Microsoft 已承诺（在指定时间范围内）遵守此设置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bde549cfba091814",
      "translationZh": "混合用途爬虫是训练问题中的难点。AI 摘要接下来。站点范围内的简单是或否太过粗糙：您的内容在摘要中出现的比例与其是否出现同样重要。对 AI 摘要的退出已经是我们对混合用途爬虫运营商设定的要求之一。到明年初，我们的目标是让您能够控制内容被包含的比例——在 Cloudflare 上一次性设置，而不是逐个运营商单独设置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "726d2dbc45f8a71c",
      "translationZh": "为什么仅仅询问不够",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90fa85c5682108ec",
      "translationZh": "大多数网站所有者希望被发现：被人类、代理和（良好）机器人发现。但开放互联网的很大一部分依赖广告、订阅或与访客的直接关系来获利，而这些模式只有在有人实际到访时才会产生收入。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e5be09241fdd38a",
      "translationZh": "几乎所有网站所有者都认为搜索有益：少于 1% 的 Cloudflare 网站选择阻止搜索机器人。然而，训练则是另一回事：17% 的网站选择启用某种机制来阻止训练。这正是我们决定网站所有者需要更细粒度的控制，而不是一刀切的“阻止 AI”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fd5a121a9980bf9",
      "translationZh": "仅靠 robots.txt 指令无法解决此问题。任何人都可以发布一条，但它无法识别爬虫是谁，确定它们爬取的目的，或阻止忽略它的爬虫。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bbbeffbcdb8a5fd",
      "translationZh": "然而，网络可以解决此问题：我们发布偏好，识别谁在爬取，分类它们爬取的原因，并阻止忽略它的爬虫——然后在 Radar 上报告每个运营商实际的行为。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3376366e2c8d9a2b",
      "translationZh": "但阻止会移除爬虫。它不会改变爬虫的行为。更好的结果是运营商不让你做出选择。因此，自七月以来，我们一直在直接与他们交谈。反馈令人鼓舞：几乎所有人都同意网站所有者应当对其内容的使用拥有控制权和透明度，并且相信他们的选择会得到尊重。为了帮助网站所有者理解这一点，我们创建了一项称号：Accountable。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21955600588119a8",
      "translationZh": "Accountable 称号既承认当前可用的功能，也承认为实现这些功能所作的具体承诺。要符合资格，机器人运营商必须满足或承诺满足以下要求：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3249e25b3e4d031c",
      "translationZh": "通过 robots.txt 或类似标准，让网站所有者选择退出 AI 训练的机制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac5d239d60e0a2ed",
      "translationZh": "让网站所有者直接通过运营商选择退出 AI 摘要的机制，以及明年通过 Cloudflare（详见下文）实现的机制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c54a3ce7ad2d790",
      "translationZh": "URL 级别的可见性，显示哪些页面被提供用于训练，并附带展示内容在搜索中出现情况的指标。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ed1e672dc259cd1",
      "translationZh": "保证选择退出 AI 训练不会影响传统搜索结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "660cfef5000cbebe",
      "translationZh": "Apple、Google 和 Microsoft 均表明他们具备成为 Accountable 的资格。每家公司都将当前可用的功能与尚在开发中的功能的有时限承诺相结合。以下将分享这些公司爬虫的详细信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b4bc9b1a6f02960",
      "translationZh": "新的安全设置选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42b0ba94f7201740",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare 根据行为对机器人进行分类，且单个机器人可以表现多种行为。有三种行为可作为控制选项：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f68f34521d22d524",
      "translationZh": "Search - 爬取以构建搜索索引。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5174c88436bd7c41",
      "translationZh": "Training - 爬取以训练或微调模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c79a508a5cbb397",
      "translationZh": "Agent - 由用户指导的代理代表人类访问页面，例如聊天抓取机器人和浏览器使用代理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c1c13b1df2513f5",
      "translationZh": "混合使用爬虫是指同时执行 Search 和 Training 的单个爬虫。如果没有控制，这种组合会产生上述权衡：网站所有者不能拒绝一种用途而不拒绝另一种用途。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "503dbb9a6d74b119",
      "translationZh": "为了避免阻止那些不会在网站所有者身上强制施加该权衡的负责任的混合使用爬虫，我们正在引入一个新设置：Disallow AI Training。Disallow AI Training 之所以如此命名，是因为它在您的 robots.txt 中发布了 Disallow: 指令。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d5b58a109063596",
      "translationZh": "“Block” 设置现在意味着不同的东西",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "638df757de61cd31",
      "translationZh": "以前，Block 和 “Block on pages with ads” 不适用于混合使用爬虫，因为阻止它们也可能影响搜索可发现性。现在我们有了新的 Disallow AI Training 设置，Block 和 “Block on pages with ads” 适用于所有训练爬虫，包括混合使用爬虫。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fe4a782a4873c0f",
      "translationZh": "Training、Search 和 Agent 的控制在域级别应用。随着 Disallow AI Training 的加入，可用的设置如下：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49f3db1c09f44e7e",
      "translationZh": "Allow：所有爬虫均被允许，除非被其他设置或 WAF 规则阻止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a100170147c7dc6",
      "translationZh": "Disallow AI Training：Bot Preference Sync 在 robots.txt 中发布适用的 no-training preference。负责任的 mixed-use crawlers 在搜索方面仍被允许。其他所有 training crawler 被阻止，包括由 Amazon、Anthropic、Meta 和 OpenAI 运行的 training-only crawlers——阻止这些爬虫不会影响搜索。Disallow AI Training 仅作为 Training 的设置可用，而不适用于 Search 或 Agent。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4cb893b177e1e843",
      "translationZh": "在带有 ads 的页面上进行 Block：包括 mixed-use crawlers 在内的爬虫仅在检测到正在服务 ad 的页面上被阻止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1fcadf51055d146",
      "translationZh": "Block：所有爬虫（包括 mixed-use crawlers）均被阻止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "131007fdb34af3f6",
      "translationZh": "Disallow AI Training 通过在 robots.txt 中发布 preference 来实现。ads-only preference 无法以这种方式表达：Cloudflare 可以检测到哪些页面在服务 ads，但该列表太大且变化太频繁，无法在 robots.txt 中枚举。这就是为什么在带有 ads 的页面上没有 Disallow AI Training。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54b92a86d92885e1",
      "translationZh": "Agents 不会像 mixed-use crawlers 那样产生相同的 search-discoverability tradeoff，且互联网目前尚未有成熟的指令来向 agents 表达 Disallow preferences。目前，我们不会为 Agents 加入 Disallow 设置。随着诸如 ai-prefs 之类的标准成熟，我们将重新审视此方法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a6970edae7f72517",
      "translationZh": "September 15 有哪些变化？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2403c64145eebbe3",
      "translationZh": "我们正在对 Bot Management 和 AI Crawl Control 进行以下更改：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "523e818708d986a2",
      "translationZh": "带有广告的页面的 Block 和 Block 设置现在适用于混合爬虫，包括 Applebot、Bingbot 和 Googlebot，因此任一设置都会影响搜索以及训练。要停止训练而保留搜索，请使用 Disallow AI Training。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d48e8e02d007f818",
      "translationZh": "“Block AI Bots” 将被弃用，以支持更细粒度的 Search、Training 和 Agent 控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd7a42ae6ee8b43e",
      "translationZh": "Managed Robots.txt 将被弃用，取而代之的是 Bot Preference Sync。已启用 Managed Robots.txt 的客户将迁移到新系统。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a02b7a56aefb0f7c",
      "translationZh": "Disallow AI Training 将成为某些新域的推荐配置的一部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "79c86c9f76d42dcc",
      "translationZh": "现有客户的偏好将按照下文所述迁移到新控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25adcc6959c328b9",
      "translationZh": "在几乎所有情况下，什么也不需要做。您当前的设置将自动保留。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b95332be970d7207",
      "translationZh": "如果您希望完全禁止混合爬虫，现在必须明确说明。选择 Block。它将阻止 Applebot、Bingbot 和 Googlebot 访问您的站点——包括搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "67a9d06929c083bf",
      "translationZh": "从未使用过 Search/Training/Agent 控件的现有域名",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a43a799b6b8ce769",
      "translationZh": "从未配置过更细粒度控件的站点所有者将根据其旧版 'Block AI Bots' 设置迁移到新设置：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bec93150f4dc2c20",
      "translationZh": "之前曾配置过 Search/Training/Agent 控件的现有域名",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e047f666f03de146",
      "translationZh": "对于之前配置过细粒度控件的域名，我们将在新定义下保留其选择的实际效果。之前的 Training 选择为 Block 或在带广告的页面上 Block 将迁移到 Disallow AI Training。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "05014e98e0f12b45",
      "translationZh": "新域名的建议",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e11ce6c79456a2c2",
      "translationZh": "从 9 月 15 日起， onboard 新域名的客户将根据站点是否通过广告赚钱，获得两种预设配置之一。广告收入取决于人类实际看到页面。Training 会用答案替换该访问；agents 会在无人看到广告的情况下获取页面。因此，广告支持站点的预设更为严格。您可以在 onboard 期间或之后随时更改这些设置中的任何一项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4029390e1dc4da4b",
      "translationZh": "新域名的推荐设置",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b15f15890ec029d",
      "translationZh": "这对特定的混合用途爬虫意味着什么？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f88c77b84bea07fd",
      "translationZh": "Applebot、Bingbot 和 Googlebot 负有责任。Apple、Google 和 Microsoft 致力于遵循相同的出版商选择和透明原则。在 Disallow AI Training 下，它们可以继续爬取您的网站以进行搜索。选择 Block 将完全阻止它们。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64dee9c4e51f36f5",
      "translationZh": "我们还将来自 Amazon、Anthropic、Meta 和 OpenAI 的相关爬虫归类为负有责任。这些组织将其搜索爬虫和训练爬虫分离，因此 Cloudflare 可以阻止训练爬虫而不影响搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c88cede1eee809c4",
      "translationZh": "Applebot 允许网站所有者通过在 robots.txt 中为 “Applebot-Extended” 添加 Disallow 规则来选择退出训练。网站所有者也可以目前通过页面 HTML 中的 nosnippet 指令表达对 AI 摘要的偏好。内容也可以被标记为付费墙内容，以将其排除在生成输出之外。Applebot 目前尚未提供 URL 级检查的工具。然而，我们已经与他们的团队会面，并且他们分享了明年进行中的解决方案的详细信息。Apple 还表示，禁止训练不会影响搜索排名。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4c4fc13aebbea75",
      "translationZh": "Googlebot 允许网站所有者通过在 robots.txt 中为 “Google-Extended” 添加 Disallow 规则来选择退出训练，并且他们在站长门户内提供一个开关，以将站点内容从生成搜索结果中排除。Googlebot 还为网站所有者提供有关搜索结果和 AI 摘要结果的指标和报告。Google 分享了他们现有及最近推出的控制措施的信息，以及他们目前正在进行的工作，包括针对站点所有者的与 Google-Extended 相关的额外 URL 级透明工具，他们预计将在未来几周内推出。Google 还表示，禁止 Google-Extended 不会影响搜索排名。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f009d18afc358ca",
      "translationZh": "Bingbot 在其站长工具中提供细粒度控制和透明度。网站所有者目前可以通过 Bing 的 NOARCHIVE meta 标签表达 AI 训练偏好。Microsoft 正在扩展这些功能，并目前正在构建机制，以在 robots.txt 的域/站点级别也尊重 “no training” 偏好，目标是 2027 年初。对于希望今天在 Bing 中退出训练的 Cloudflare 客户，除了使用 NOARCHIVE 标签外，网站所有者还可以使用 Block URLs 或 Content Removal 工具。Microsoft 还表示，使用 NOARCHIVE 不会影响搜索排名。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75be5a382166f44f",
      "translationZh": "在该支持推出之前，选择 Disallow AI Training 不会通过 robots.txt 自动向 Bing 传达无训练偏好。这与之前的 Training Block 设置具有相同的实际行为，该设置不适用于诸如 Bingbot 之类的混合用途爬虫。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1996fdba1997c8a7",
      "translationZh": "我们将继续随着这些能力的演变，与所有 AI 爬虫运营商保持联系和互动。Cloudflare Radar 将公开跟踪由负有责任的爬虫运营商提供的控制、透明度和报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fcc96aa460cf9f0",
      "translationZh": "让互联网变得更好需要双方都具备能动性：爬虫需要访问开放的网络，而创建该网络的人需要对其作品的使用方式拥有有意义的控制。今天的公告代表了朝着这种平衡的具体进展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9942f4fc543ce2d9",
      "translationZh": "进步需要基础设施提供者、内容创作者、技术公司以及诸如 Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF) 之类的标准组织共同努力，将这些原则转化为开放、互操作的标准。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1d404271956bf26e",
      "translationZh": "接下来：AI Summaries",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b93dea0a323af8a0",
      "translationZh": "Training 和 AI Summaries 对站点所有者提出了不同的问题。Training 涉及内容是否可用于构建 AI models。Summaries 影响人们如何发现、评估以及最终访问一家企业。两者都很重要，但它们以不同的方式影响企业。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7ca25625e611961",
      "translationZh": "Controls to opt out of AI summaries 是第一步。被标识为 Accountable 的运营商 entweder提供或正在完成工作以提供该功能，建立了一个重要的基线：site owners 可以拒绝。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be2495cb31fd6d82",
      "translationZh": "但 site-wide 在允许和禁止 summaries 之间的选择仍然是一个粗暴的工具。正确的决定取决于站点、内容以及业务结果。对于出版商，training 基础性问题涉及控制、补偿以及原始内容的可持续性。Summaries 创造了一个独立且通常更直接的分发问题：有人是访问出版商的站点，还是在搜索或 AI experience 中消费答案？对于许多其他企业，AI summaries 越来越多地位于潜在客户和网站之间。它们可能回答问题、比较替代方案、推荐产品，或帮助某人决定是否至少访问一次。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9d277c1cf101d43",
      "translationZh": "数据显示影响混合。超过一半的消费者在 Search 中阅读 summaries，这些消费者在阅读后结束搜索的可能性高出 40%。这可能会减少网站收到的访问次数。但被 AI Search 引导的消费者转化率是被 traditional search 引导的消费者的三倍到超过五倍。AI 可能会产生更少的访问，但会带来意图更强烈的客户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f63df25221d0cb16",
      "translationZh": "这本身并非好或坏。由广告资助的出版商可能会优化受众规模。零售商可能更倾向于拥有更少但更有可能购买的访客。Cloudflare’s role 不是为他们选择，而是提供他们做出明智决策所需的可见性和控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41bf8cfb57104162",
      "translationZh": "Summary opt-outs 是一个良好的开端，但它们不是最终状态。我们接下来的重点是帮助 site owners 了解 summaries 如何影响他们的业务，并让他们对可以使用的内容量有更多控制。Open standards 如 ai-prefs 将是实现这一点的重要部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bbfcfacf4c4908a",
      "translationZh": "如果您希望在此对话中发表意见或提供反馈，请联系 crawlercontrols@cloudflare.com 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2391b3a7df4ba7ea",
      "translationZh": "这些新控制面向所有客户、所有套餐开放，可在域名（区域）安全设置中进行配置。尚未使用 Cloudflare？立即免费开始，设置您想要的流量控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
